{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Innkeeper VR \u2013 Your Medieval Tavern Awaits!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the shoes of a medieval tavern keeper in a bustling fantasy world! In Innkeeper VR, you control every detail of your tavern, from cooking to cleaning, serving to managing unruly guests.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What Awaits You:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cook:</strong> Purchase fresh ingredients, chop vegetables, grind grains, and turn them into a cauldron of flavorful stew or a barrel of the finest alcohol. Experiment boldly to discover new recipes and bring in even more shiny coins!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Clean &amp; Serve:</strong> Keep your tavern spotless, pour drinks, serve meals, and ensure guests leave happy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Handle Chaos:</strong> Break up brawls, stop theft, and physically throw out troublemakers to maintain peace and protect your earnings.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hire Staff:</strong> Recruit a bard to charm patrons, a waitress to serve faster, a cleaner to tidy up, and eventually a cook to handle recipes in your expanding establishment.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customize:</strong> Decorate your tavern to reflect your vision, whether it\u2019s a cozy retreat, a hunter\u2019s lodge, or a noble\u2019s haven.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Expand:</strong> Start small and grow into a grand, prestigious inn with guest rooms, a bigger kitchen, and space for more visitors.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your story begins now \u2014 grab your tankard and prove your worth as the ultimate innkeeper!</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Coin Collector","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3815170/fd426fbc30f38c7daa5c1adb7d1744d25558b818.jpg"},{"name":"Wealthy Host","path":"https://cd